{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は生ドルでした～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん不在のため\nさゆりんご軍団のかりん、琴子、蘭世が\n来てくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんご軍団だよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすがのかりん\n2次元の琴子\n眼球占いの蘭世"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完璧な布陣でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A応Pさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/02/28/7406094/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福緒唯さん、水希蒼さん、広瀬ゆうきさん\nカナヲくん神対応されて\nハッピーだったらしいですよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"callmeさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2017/02/28/7406094/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"RUUNAさん、MIMORIさん、KOUMIさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテールさせていただき\nありがとうございます～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださって\nありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、エンディングでは\nおに魂で解禁したばっかりの\n『インフルエンサー』を\n流しちゃいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急遽だったんだけど\n流せて良かった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスナンバーなのでね\n早く披露したいものです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの感想お待ちしてまーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ドル観てくれてありがとう～\nまた来月もよろしく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかだかな"}],"source":"archive"}